[
    {
        "content": "<p>The counterexamples are coming fast! Dmitry Rybin found a counterexample to the Dinitz-Garg-Goemans conjecture in graph theory (more precisely, Goemans' exact-cost strengthening of the 1999 DGG theorem). He used GPT 5.6-Pro <a href=\"https://x.com/DmitryRybin1/status/2079904005652893709\">Posting in X</a>. He also published the <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/share/6a60b2eb-0b64-83ee-9c76-7931ca1de063\">GPT 5.6-Pro transcript</a>.</p>\n<p>I've created a formal proof (with Claude) in Lean 4 in <a href=\"https://github.com/jyh/dinitz-verify\">github.com/jyh/dinitz-verify</a>. The main theorem is this: <code>goemans_cost_conjecture_false</code> — the conjecture stated in the paper <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.02651\">Single-Source Unsplittable Flows in Planar Graphs</a> (Conjecture 1.3), refuted over ℚ. Every result depends on at most <code>[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]</code> (no <code>native_decide</code>).</p>\n<p>Key ideas: we prove path-completeness (with a rank function + a verified bounded enumerator — the six paths are computed); then verify that the 1999 DGG theorem holds in this instance (so the refutation isolates the cost clause); and then prove two-sided 2·d_max feasibility, so the instance does not conflict with the survey’s planar theorems (which allow 2·d_max).</p>\n<p>Similar to <a href=\"https://github.com/jyh/jacobian-verify\">github.com/jyh/jacobian-verify</a>, I'd like to open a PR to mathlib's <code>Counterexamples</code>. I'd welcome any comments or collaboration!</p>",
        "id": 612748998,
        "sender_full_name": "Jason Hickey",
        "timestamp": 1784999891
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Can you organize your repo so not everything is placed into a single <code>[Dinitz.lean](https://github.com/jyh/dinitz-verify/blob/main/Dinitz.lean)</code> file?</p>\n<p>It would be nice if there was a single <code>challenge.lean</code> file stating only the precise theorem you are trying to prove (i.e. <code>goemans_cost_conjecture_false</code>) and importing only mathlib. Then put the proof elsewhere and make sure it passes comparator, I think most modern LLMs  should be able to help you set this up.</p>",
        "id": 612774136,
        "sender_full_name": "Jack McCarthy",
        "timestamp": 1785024250
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"989743\">Jack McCarthy</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/583339-AI-authored-projects/topic/Counterexample.20to.20Dinitz-Garg-Goemans.20conjecture/near/612774136\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can you organize your repo</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Thank you, Jack. I appreciate the pointer to the format. I've restructured into the comparator layout: 1) <code>Challenge.lean</code> holds definitions + the <code>goemans_cost_conjecture_false</code> statement only, imports only <code>mathlib</code>, 2) <code>Submission.lean</code> is the full proof, in the <code>Submission</code> namespace, 3) <code>check.py</code> builds and checks the axioms, and type-checks the bridge (<code>example : ¬ DGGCostConjectureFull ℚ := Submission.goemans_cost_conjecture_false</code>).</p>\n<p>Happy to also PR this to mathlib's Counterexamples, if that would be welcome.</p>\n<p>Best, Jason</p>",
        "id": 612779227,
        "sender_full_name": "Jason Hickey",
        "timestamp": 1785025889
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Unfortunately, I don't think this would be appropriate for Mathlib's Counterexamples. If somebody wants it then feel free to correct me, but my understanding is that Counterexamples is kept intentionally small so that we don't spam it with counterexamples to random conjectures.</p>\n<p>However, it is quite likely that this project could help expose some missing infrastructure for flows in Mathlib's graph theory library. For instance, your current statement of the main theorem is quite lengthy, which indicates to me that there are potentially some missing definitions in Mathlib to state this idiomatically:</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Conjecture Code</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DGGCostConjectureFull</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LinearOrder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">IsStrictOrderedRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">DecidableEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">DecidableEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dmax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- the digraph is simple, loopless and acyclic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Injective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- capacities, with the source's standing hypothesis</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- the terminals are distinct from each other and from the source</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Injective</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- demands are positive and `dmax` is the maximum demand</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dmax</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dmax</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- nonnegative costs and a nonnegative flow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- `x` is a feasible single-source flow for the demands</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- conclusion</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsWalk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uload</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dmax</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uload</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∑</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DGG</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
